<%@ Page language="c#" CodeBehind="Logoff.aspx.cs" AutoEventWireup="True" 
    Inherits="ASPNET.StarterKit.Portal.Logoff" MasterPageFile="~/Default.master" %>

<%--
   <lang>
     <zh-CN>注销页通过母版页承载，但页面自身不声明可见服务器控件；实际退出动作由 code-behind 在页面生命周期内完成。</zh-CN>
     <en>The logoff page is hosted by the master page but declares no visible server controls; the actual sign-out action is completed by the code-behind during the page lifecycle.</en>
   </lang>
--%>
<%--
   <lang>
     <zh-CN>该入口来自页眉注销按钮；页面只负责终止认证状态并回到门户首页，不读取或展示业务数据。</zh-CN>
     <en>This endpoint is reached from the header logoff button; it only terminates authentication state and returns to the portal home page, without reading or displaying business data.</en>
   </lang>
--%>
